Cell["\<\
Assuming the likelihood is approximately Gaussian, we can  estimate the \
standard deviation on the model parameters \[Theta]\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.987212591948326*^9, 3.987212626801345*^9}, {
   3.98721414705451*^9, 3.9872141964769897`*^9}, {3.987214264200005*^9, 
