 CellLabel->"In[9]:=",ExpressionUUID->"6ecf80fd-afd6-43c0-8663-215df3b193fa"],

Cell["\<\
If our samplers did a good job, this should be approximately the width of the \
posteriors we obtained (because we  assumed uniform priors).  And, in fact, \
it is! Here we load posterior samples from L05. (The original notebook did \
not save the samples, so you can either rerun the updated version or just \
download the sample file from the repo.)\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.987212591948326*^9, 3.987212626801345*^9}, {
   3.98721414705451*^9, 3.9872141964769897`*^9}, {3.987214264200005*^9, 
   3.987214303385498*^9}, {3.98721434225368*^9, 3.9872143812096033`*^9}, 
   3.987214446537437*^9, {3.987214573387493*^9, 3.9872146229602633`*^9}, {
   3.9872150226648207`*^9, 3.987215070037407*^9}, {3.987215245450569*^9, 
   3.987215359936054*^9}, 3.987215451268074*^9, {3.987215761819269*^9, 
   3.9872158695164557`*^9}, {3.987215921963995*^9, 3.987216046756652*^9}, {
   3.9872161308085203`*^9, 3.987216138586874*^9}, {3.9874739771797543`*^9, 
   3.987474014491938*^9}, {3.987474056001255*^9, 3.987474210708922*^9}, 
   3.987474345449102*^9, {3.9875219332857513`*^9, 3.987521938876709*^9}, {
   3.987522537690969*^9, 3.987522605987178*^9}, {3.987555466268105*^9, 
   3.987555522840074*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"a5429036-ab9e-4137-8cfa-\
7bed5ec3acf4"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"posteriorTrue", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"Import", "[", "\"\<L05_bayes/posterior_MCMC.csv\>\"", "]"}], "//",
     "Flatten"}]}], ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
 RowBox[{"Sqrt", "[", 
  RowBox[{"Variance", "[", "posteriorTrue", "]"}], "]"}]}], "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9875225865807953`*^9, 3.9875225916420803`*^9}},
 CellLabel->"In[14]:=",ExpressionUUID->"33f3791c-bb54-44e2-afa4-631f24360ac7"],

Cell["\<\
However, the expression above is not the Fisher Information Matrix (FIM). The \
FIM is not a statement about a specific data realization but, instead, an \
expectation value taken over the data generation process: \
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.987212591948326*^9, 3.987212626801345*^9}, {
   3.98721414705451*^9, 3.9872141964769897`*^9}, {3.987214264200005*^9, 
   3.987214303385498*^9}, {3.98721434225368*^9, 3.9872143812096033`*^9}, 
   3.987214446537437*^9, {3.987214573387493*^9, 3.9872146229602633`*^9}, {
