Cell[TextData[{
 "\nWhen the following criteria are met, ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  SuperscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
   RowBox[{"-", "1"}]]],
  CellChangeTimes->{{3.987212591948326*^9, 3.987212626801345*^9}, {
    3.98721414705451*^9, 3.9872141964769897`*^9}, {3.987214264200005*^9, 
    3.987214303385498*^9}, {3.98721434225368*^9, 3.9872143812096033`*^9}, 
    3.987214446537437*^9, {3.987214573387493*^9, 3.9872146229602633`*^9}, {
    3.9872150226648207`*^9, 3.987215070037407*^9}, {3.987215245450569*^9, 
    3.987215359936054*^9}, 3.987215451268074*^9, {3.987215761819269*^9, 
    3.9872158695164557`*^9}, {3.987215921963995*^9, 3.987216046756652*^9}, {
    3.9872161308085203`*^9, 3.987216138586874*^9}, {3.987217430023179*^9, 
    3.987217438546617*^9}, {3.9872207739561453`*^9, 3.98722081923396*^9}, {
    3.9872209624989243`*^9, 3.987220986699382*^9}, {3.987474242953703*^9, 
    3.987474243306519*^9}, {3.987474324802842*^9, 3.9874744903200607`*^9}, {
    3.9874745477378683`*^9, 3.987474590440999*^9}, {3.9874746302678432`*^9, 
    3.987474803993239*^9}, {3.987474839008417*^9, 3.987474840164009*^9}, {
    3.987474888645403*^9, 3.987474960285726*^9}, {3.987482653703458*^9, 
    3.9874826539643393`*^9}, {3.9874827204346733`*^9, 3.987482900073409*^9}, {
    3.9874829376989803`*^9, 3.98748302430999*^9}, {3.9874940211199827`*^9, 
    3.98749402117934*^9}, {3.9874940570494843`*^9, 3.9874940576108103`*^9}, {
    3.987494129396502*^9, 3.987494272879237*^9}, {3.9875224559856863`*^9, 
    3.987522482135789*^9}, {3.9875227480234013`*^9, 3.987522771614781*^9}, {
    3.987522814405443*^9, 3.987522869366563*^9}},ExpressionUUID->
  "d01ba0bb-b3ab-4218-a67d-0a3a7e2a3e12"],
 " is exactly the covariance matrix of the posterior PDF\n- The SNR is large \
\n- The waveform is a linear function of the model parameters\n- The priors \
are wide and flat on the relevant area of parameter space\n\nThese \
assumptions are equivalent to the posterior PDF being approximately  \
Gaussian.  See arXiv:gr-qc/0703086 for proofs of these criteria. \n\nThese \
criteria are never exactly met for any realistic waveform, but we can still \
use ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  SuperscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
   RowBox[{"-", "1"}]]],
  CellChangeTimes->{{3.987212591948326*^9, 3.987212626801345*^9}, {
    3.98721414705451*^9, 3.9872141964769897`*^9}, {3.987214264200005*^9, 
    3.987214303385498*^9}, {3.98721434225368*^9, 3.9872143812096033`*^9}, 
    3.987214446537437*^9, {3.987214573387493*^9, 3.9872146229602633`*^9}, {
    3.9872150226648207`*^9, 3.987215070037407*^9}, {3.987215245450569*^9, 
    3.987215359936054*^9}, 3.987215451268074*^9, {3.987215761819269*^9, 
    3.9872158695164557`*^9}, {3.987215921963995*^9, 3.987216046756652*^9}, {
    3.9872161308085203`*^9, 3.987216138586874*^9}, {3.987217430023179*^9, 
    3.987217438546617*^9}, {3.9872207739561453`*^9, 3.98722081923396*^9}, {
    3.9872209624989243`*^9, 3.987220986699382*^9}, {3.987474242953703*^9, 
    3.987474243306519*^9}, {3.987474324802842*^9, 3.9874744903200607`*^9}, {
    3.9874745477378683`*^9, 3.987474590440999*^9}, {3.9874746302678432`*^9, 
    3.987474803993239*^9}, {3.987474839008417*^9, 3.987474840164009*^9}, {
    3.987474888645403*^9, 3.987474960285726*^9}, {3.987482653703458*^9, 
    3.9874826539643393`*^9}, {3.9874827204346733`*^9, 3.987482900073409*^9}, {
    3.9874829376989803`*^9, 3.98748302430999*^9}, {3.9874940211199827`*^9, 
    3.98749402117934*^9}, {3.9874940570494843`*^9, 3.9874940576108103`*^9}, {
    3.987494129396502*^9, 3.987494272879237*^9}, {3.9875224559856863`*^9, 
    3.987522482135789*^9}, {3.9875227480234013`*^9, 3.987522771614781*^9}, {
    3.987522814405443*^9, 3.987522869366563*^9}},ExpressionUUID->
  "a5f26827-e826-459c-98a5-3c8fbe9933ee"],
 " to approximate the credible intervals we would obtain from a full Bayesian \
analysis as well as the correlations between pairs of parameters. \n\n\n\
Recall that the SNR is ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"\[Rho]", "  ", "=", " ", 
   SqrtBox[
    RowBox[{"(", 
     RowBox[{"h", "|", "h"}], ")"}]]}]],
  CellChangeTimes->{{3.987212591948326*^9, 3.987212626801345*^9}, {
    3.98721414705451*^9, 3.9872141964769897`*^9}, {3.987214264200005*^9, 
