    3.9875232149758387`*^9},ExpressionUUID->
  "c77d5669-945d-4883-b59e-86b5d313119e"],
 " and lengths in terms of Mpc, so we need to include the appropriate factors \
so that ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"[", 
    OverscriptBox["h", "~"], "]"}], " ", "=", " ", "s"}]],
  CellChangeTimes->{{3.884353995595696*^9, 3.884354067893775*^9}, {
    3.8843541499244947`*^9, 3.8843544300078297`*^9}, {3.884354506534966*^9, 
