   3.9875566882383842`*^9},ExpressionUUID->"22c48e01-11f2-4382-9c53-\
0b865173d392"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "We use the standard minimum frequency 20 Hz and because we are using an \
inspiral only waveform, we cut off the integration at ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  SubscriptBox["f", "ISCO"]],
  CellChangeTimes->{{3.884354674835232*^9, 3.884354769469817*^9}, {
   3.8843549150426826`*^9, 3.884354918476428*^9}, {3.884355035077383*^9, 
