Cell[TextData[{
 "Finally, we define the FIM \nThe function takes: \n - the frequency domain \
strain ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  OverscriptBox["h", "~"]],
  CellChangeTimes->{{3.884354674835232*^9, 3.884354769469817*^9}, {
   3.8843549150426826`*^9, 3.884354918476428*^9}, {3.884355035077383*^9, 
   3.884355048758194*^9}, {3.88435508735155*^9, 3.884355092160668*^9}, {
   3.884355241109572*^9, 3.8843552420115213`*^9}, {3.884355741035067*^9, 
   3.884355805488061*^9}, {3.8844361424164248`*^9, 3.884436142554173*^9}, {
   3.987495411187292*^9, 3.98749546654257*^9}, {3.987495529998207*^9, 
   3.987495766232811*^9}, {3.987495861486472*^9, 3.9874960321335793`*^9}, {
   3.987523700296112*^9, 3.987523709078538*^9}},ExpressionUUID->
  "c547c2c0-9761-40c7-9d93-e176ed9f6d5d"],
 " and its conjugate\n - a list of the parameters for which we want to \
compute the FIM\n - a list of those parameter' s values (in the same order as \
the previous list)\n - and the maximum frequency value we want to integrate \
to "
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.884354674835232*^9, 3.884354769469817*^9}, {
  3.8843549150426826`*^9, 3.884354918476428*^9}, {3.884355035077383*^9, 
  3.884355048758194*^9}, {3.88435508735155*^9, 3.884355092160668*^9}, {
