bc695b691d38"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "We are going to compare the approximate posterior obtained through a Fisher \
analysis to the sampling of the true posterior obtained through Bayesian \
parameter  estimation. \n\nWe will consider a non-spinning system with ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   SubscriptBox["m", "1"], " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"15", " ", 
    SubscriptBox["M", 
     RowBox[{"\[CircleDot]", " "}]]}]}]],
  CellChangeTimes->{{3.9872171772678413`*^9, 3.987217184883375*^9}, {
    3.9874882242669888`*^9, 3.987488257144709*^9}, {3.987488293426818*^9, 
    3.987488837151437*^9}, {3.98748924328406*^9, 3.987489244524992*^9}, {
    3.987489278032262*^9, 3.987489310245287*^9}, 3.9874893742177143`*^9, {
    3.987489410140876*^9, 3.987489446848838*^9}, {3.987490137897176*^9, 
    3.987490169546139*^9}, {3.987490228546022*^9, 3.98749022916411*^9}, {
    3.98749033855897*^9, 3.98749036487938*^9}, 3.987529540219737*^9},
  ExpressionUUID->"426ae94b-63ac-4e5d-a6a0-fd3dccf73702"],
 "and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{" ", 
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox["m", "2"], " ", "=", " ", 
    RowBox[{"5", " ", 
     SubscriptBox["M", 
      RowBox[{"\[CircleDot]", " "}]]}]}]}]],
  CellChangeTimes->{{3.9872171772678413`*^9, 3.987217184883375*^9}, {
    3.9874882242669888`*^9, 3.987488257144709*^9}, {3.987488293426818*^9, 
    3.987488837151437*^9}, {3.98748924328406*^9, 3.987489244524992*^9}, {
    3.987489278032262*^9, 3.987489310245287*^9}, 3.9874893742177143`*^9, {
    3.987489410140876*^9, 3.987489446848838*^9}, {3.987490137897176*^9, 
    3.987490169546139*^9}, {3.987490228546022*^9, 3.98749022916411*^9}, {
    3.98749033855897*^9, 3.98749036487938*^9}, 3.987529540219737*^9},
  ExpressionUUID->"e8a28f6d-4787-49a3-8104-884a1028486d"],
 ", corresponding to ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"\[ScriptCapitalM]", " ", "~", " ", "7.33"}], "  ", 
   SubscriptBox["M", 
    RowBox[{"\[CircleDot]", " "}]]}]],
  CellChangeTimes->{{3.9872171772678413`*^9, 3.987217184883375*^9}, {
    3.9874882242669888`*^9, 3.987488257144709*^9}, {3.987488293426818*^9, 
    3.987488837151437*^9}, {3.98748924328406*^9, 3.987489244524992*^9}, {
    3.987489278032262*^9, 3.987489310245287*^9}, 3.9874893742177143`*^9, {
    3.987489410140876*^9, 3.987489446848838*^9}, {3.987490137897176*^9, 
    3.987490169546139*^9}, {3.987490228546022*^9, 3.98749022916411*^9}, {
    3.98749033855897*^9, 3.98749036487938*^9}, 3.987529540219737*^9},
  ExpressionUUID->"727db963-c407-44e0-ac0e-845c0d47fddd"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"q", " ", "=", " ", 
   FractionBox["1", "3"]}]],
  CellChangeTimes->{{3.9872171772678413`*^9, 3.987217184883375*^9}, {
    3.9874882242669888`*^9, 3.987488257144709*^9}, {3.987488293426818*^9, 
    3.987488837151437*^9}, {3.98748924328406*^9, 3.987489244524992*^9}, {
    3.987489278032262*^9, 3.987489310245287*^9}, 3.9874893742177143`*^9, {
    3.987489410140876*^9, 3.987489446848838*^9}, {3.987490137897176*^9, 
    3.987490169546139*^9}, {3.987490228546022*^9, 3.98749022916411*^9}, {
    3.98749033855897*^9, 3.98749036487938*^9}, 3.987529540219737*^9},
  ExpressionUUID->"105c2159-e113-440f-b043-fc22d9690ef7"],
 ", and an SNR of approximately 200. We will produce the signal with \
theTaylorF2 waveform into a single LIGO detector.  \n\nTo save time, we will \
only sample on two parameters, \[ScriptCapitalM] and q, which is the standard \
choice for binary parameter estimation. \n\nThe posteriors used for \
comparison in this notebook were generated with L07_FIM_PC/PE.ipynb and are \
saved in L07_FIM_PCA/samples_chirp_mass_mass_ratio_q3.csv and \
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]L07_FIM_PCA/samples_chirp_mass_mass_ratio_q1.csv"
}], "Text",
