abd238909ac2"],

Cell["\<\
Parameter estimation can be tricky when parameters are strongly correlated. \
We can use the FIM to identify combinations of the model parameters that are \
less correlated than the original parameters. 

See arXiv:1304.7017 for an overview. \
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.987527512398239*^9, 
  3.98752757663632*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"cc97d04e-5143-4ee6-9ac7-\
80170464becf"],

